OL,3,GNEWSABullying claims a 'work of
OL,4,Afiction', Labour MSP Monica Lennon says
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour MSP Monica Lennon has described
OL,7,Fbullying allegations against her as a
OL,8,F"work of fiction".
OL,10,FIt comes after The Scotsman reported
OL,11,Fthat four of Lennon's former staffers
OL,12,Fhad accused her of bullying.
OL,14,FLennon condemned what she called
OL,15,F"vexatious complaints" and "hit jobs in
OL,16,Fthe media".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
