OL,3,GNEWSABullying claims a 'work of
OL,4,Afiction', Labour MSP Monica Lennon says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Marra, who saw off competition
OL,7,Ffrom Lennon to win the Scottish Labour
OL,8,Fleadership this summer, said earlier
OL,9,Fthat neither the party nor its
OL,10,Fparliamentary group had received a
OL,11,Fcomplaint.
